ond row:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}I & =[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{1} & :={R}_{1}+8{R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}1 & 8 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}] \\\\  & =E\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $EA$ is equivalent to applying the row operation ${R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+8{R}_{2}$ to $A.$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058391/state.json" "file_sha256" "0ed986bac74899e8028869cf48c173abd4f261de39e3b88a3303a9d660e75927"} {"question" "q-130844" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058391/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "9814f4a50ae065ff0445b5d3e2eac15b0c30e0d777627cdd25265d2451ba5c32"} {"question" "q-130844" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058391/state.json" "file_sha256" "0ed986bac74899e8028869cf48c173abd4f261de39e3b88a3303a9d660e75927"} {"question" "q-130844" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "{R}_{1}:=8{R}_{1}"] ["math" "{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+(-8){R}_{2}"] ["math" "{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+8{R}_{2}"] ["math" "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+(-8){R}_{1}"] ["math" "{R}_{2}:={R}_{2}+8{R}_{1}"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058391/state.json" "file_sha256" "0ed986bac74899e8028869cf48c173abd4f261de39e3b88a3303a9d660e75927"} {"question" "q-130844" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "{R}_{1}:={R}_{1}+8{R}_{2}"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture-workers/linear/14058391/state.json" "file_s